3 "[CERTIFIED MEAT PROCESSING FACILITIES]
4
5 Section 351.
6
7 (a) There is appropriated to the office of the governor fifty
8 million dollars ($50,000,000.00) from the legislative
9 stabilization reserve account. Subject to subsections (b) through
10 (f) of this section, this appropriation is to provide matching
11 funds for private or federal funding for construction of meat
12 processing facilities. This appropriation shall not be transferred
13 or expended for any other purpose. It is the intent of the
14 legislature that this appropriation not be included in the office
15 of the governor's standard budget for the immediately succeeding
16 fiscal biennium.
17
18 (b) Expenditure of funds under this section shall be
19 conditioned upon receipt of matching funds in the ratio of one
20 dollar ($1.00) of appropriated funds under this section to not
21 less than one dollar ($1.00) of matching funds from any nonstate
22 source.
23
24 (c) The department of agriculture shall administer the
25 application process, review grant submissions and opportunities
26 and recommend qualified funding applications under this section.
27 The governor shall approve all final awards of funds appropriated
28 under this section.
29
30 (d) No award shall be granted that would obligate the state
31 to any future financial commitment beyond the amount of the initial
32 award.
33
34 (e) For purposes of this section, "meat processing
35 facilities" means facilities working as a cooperative and
36 certified, or in the process of being certified, by the United
37 States department of agriculture.
1

1
2 (f) All proposed expenditures from this appropriation and
3 the purposes and goals of each expenditure shall be reported to
4 the management council of the legislature and the joint
5 appropriations committee prior to the expenditure being made. The
6 management council shall review and make a recommendation on all
7 proposed expenditures prior to expenditure by the governor.".
8
9 To the extent required by this amendment: adjust totals; and
10 renumber as necessary. ROTHFUSS
